#49506
"Tangled Swamp"
"Huge, dead trees close in all directions except east, where barren
swathes of mud form a kind of trail leading into the lifeless forest. 
The earth is devoid of life, and is, instead, a fetid, detrital mush of
rotted organisms.  The forest is utterly quiet, except for the
occassional, lonely rattle of a soft wind through the bare branches of
the dead, gray trees.
"
""
301465600 0
