#49507
"Tangled Swamp"
"A forest of the dead stands in all directions, the trees defoliated,
their rotted limbs lying half-buried in a black, slushy ooze on the
ground.  The stench of decays is overpowering--a gray misasma clinging to
the earth, trees, and air.  A faint, muddy path heads south.
"
""
