#49601
"Tangled Swamp"
"Stangant water heads straight east and west, undercutting the dark soil
to the north and south and leaving exposed long, twisted tree roots. 
Although the plants on the banks look quite healthy, the plants that grow
in the water look sickly--the pale grass bends until it nearly touches
the surface, and the cattails are short and emaciated.
"
