"Tangled Swamp"
"The stangant water bends here, stretching off to the north and west
between muddy, tree-covered banks.  The vegetation is thick--tall, rough
grass and cattails jut from the surface of the brackish.  The trees on
the banks lean over, their tops touching and forming a heavy canopy high
above.
"
