#49603
"Tangled Swamp"
"Thick, yellow-green grass sprouts in thick clusters from the surface of
the brakish water.  There is a kind of path here as the murky, stagnant
water moves between the high, muddy, tree-covered banks.  The air is
thick with a musky, vegetal stench, and the water reeks of decay.  The
swamp heads to the south and east.
"
